  "The JSONL entries frozen in the result bundle. They are stored with the imported copy and are not affected by deleting run records or by later changes to local JSONL files.": "这里展示结果 bundle 中冻结的 JSONL 条目。它们随导入结果副本保存，不会被运行记录删除或本机 JSONL 文件之后的修改覆盖。",
  "The JSONL holds no JSON object that can be parsed; blank lines and # comments are ignored.": "JSONL 中没有可解析的 JSON 对象；空行与 # 注释会被忽略。",
